{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01NNjxr6UcJP7XXhBkJyk2pL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I have all the data. Let me construct the full worst-tier predictions based on the existing MVP results, the planned experiments, and the worst-tier definition.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 claim 从 \"adaptive b* replaces grid search\" 全面后退。finer grid 揭示真最优 b\n  在 0.1-0.3 区间，adaptive b* median ~0.87 系统性 overshoot 约 4×。60% 污染和 3B\n  模型下效应未显著放大，cross-generator 场景 adaptive 甚至劣于 uniform。\n  Reframe 1: α_eff(b) 作为 diagnostic framework——b* 轨迹揭示 batch-level 污染结构，\n  即使不产出最优 b 也提供 Drayson 框架缺乏的可解释性工具。\n  Reframe 2: loss reweighting vs SIR 的系统对比（同一 b 下 gradient variance 和\n  收敛行为差异）升级为独立 contribution。\n  Reframe 3: lightweight detector sufficiency（TF-IDF+LR AUC=0.939 vs ModernBERT\n  AUC=0.986 → PPL 差异 <0.005）成为 primary finding——\"you don't need an expensive\n  detector\"。\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"adaptive b* provides a reasonable default in most settings\"；\n  Claim 1 弱化为 \"principled analysis tool\"。投稿仍冲 EMNLP，靠 framework +\n  implementation comparison + detector finding 三条线撑住。\n  关键叙事转折：adaptive 不是最优解，但它是零成本的合理默认值，且 b* 轨迹本身\n  具有诊断价值。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.1: b<0.5 Grid Extension — 确认最优 b 在搜索边界外\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: >\n      在现有 grid (b=0.5~5.0) 基础上向低 b 区间扩展。\n      worst 档核心预测：真最优 b 在 0.1-0.3 区间，b=0.5 并非 grid-best。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.55\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.60\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s_per_b: 13000\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      train_loss 与 b 正相关（更大 b → 更多 downweight 合成样本 → 去掉低 loss 的\n      合成样本后均值上升）。b=0.1 的 train_loss (7.55) 仅略高于 uniform (7.31)，\n      因为 w=(1-q)^0.1 对 q=0.9 仍给出权重 0.79，几乎不降权。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练顺利完成，train_loss 在 [7.55, 8.60] 区间，与 b 值正相关趋势一致。\n      关键判断需等 post-hoc eval (p0_grid_b_low_eval) 出 PPL 数据。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: >\n      seed123 的 b<0.5 grid 扩展，用于 cross-seed consistency 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.57\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.97\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.62\n      total_steps: 6103\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 b=0.5 grid 中表现最好 (PPL=17.638)，low-b 区间预计保持相同趋势。\n      train_loss 与 seed42 相当，seed 间差异 <1%。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练完成，模式与 seed42 一致。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: >\n      seed456 的 b<0.5 grid 扩展。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.52\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.91\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.55\n      total_steps: 6103\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 uniform train_loss (7.29) 略低于其他 seed，low-b grid 保持一致偏移。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练完成，等 eval 结果。\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: >\n      对 3 seeds × 3 b-values = 9 个 checkpoint 做 holdout eval，获取 PPL。\n      worst 档核心预测：b=0.2 在所有 seed 上 PPL 低于 b=0.5，成为新 grid-best，\n      使 adaptive 的 aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 ~70%。\n    expected_results:\n      # seed42 (uniform=17.690)\n      b0_1_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.645\n      b0_2_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.637\n      b0_3_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      # seed123 (uniform=17.690)\n      b0_1_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.631\n      b0_2_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.625\n      b0_3_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.629\n      # seed456 (uniform=17.700)\n      b0_1_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.642\n      b0_2_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.636\n      b0_3_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.640\n      new_grid_best_b: 0.2\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed42: 17.637\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed123: 17.625\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed456: 17.636\n      old_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      # 重算 adaptive ratio（adaptive PPL 不变）\n      new_ratio_seed42_pct: 75.5   # (17.690-17.650)/(17.690-17.637)\n      new_ratio_seed123_pct: 72.3  # (17.690-17.643)/(17.690-17.625)\n      new_ratio_seed456_pct: 62.5  # (17.700-17.660)/(17.700-17.636)\n      new_aggregate_ratio_pct: 69.8\n      max_relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.37  # seed123, b=0.2: (17.690-17.625)/17.690\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设：真最优 b 远低于 adaptive b* median (~0.87)。\n      物理解释：FineWeb 中 40% Qwen-self 合成数据质量尚可（非噪声），过度降权\n      (b>0.5) 等同于丢弃可用信号。b=0.2 时 w=(1-0.9)^0.2=0.63，contaminated\n      样本仍保留 63% 权重——温和降权保留数据量的同时轻微纠正污染偏移。\n      b=0.5 时 w=0.32，已过度降权；adaptive median b*=0.87 时 w=0.13，更加激进。\n      PPL 曲线在 b=0.2 形成 U 型最低点：b<0.2 降权不足（污染信号残留），\n      b>0.2 降权过度（有效数据量损失超过去污染收益）。\n      aggregate ratio 从 88.6% (b=0.5 为 grid-best) 降至 69.8% (b=0.2 为 grid-best)，\n      进入 worst 档 [55, 80] 范围。adaptive 的 overshoot 问题暴露无遗。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Full Grid-b PPL Curve (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n        rows:\n          - {b: 0.1, seed42: 17.645, seed123: 17.631, seed456: 17.642}\n          - {b: 0.2, seed42: 17.637, seed123: 17.625, seed456: 17.636}\n          - {b: 0.3, seed42: 17.641, seed123: 17.629, seed456: 17.640}\n          - {b: 0.5, seed42: 17.651, seed123: 17.638, seed456: 17.650}\n          - {b: 1.0, seed42: 17.692, seed123: 17.674, seed456: 17.680}\n          - {b: 1.5, seed42: 17.718, seed123: 17.701, seed456: 17.710}\n          - {b: 2.0, seed42: 17.741, seed123: 17.725, seed456: \"~17.73\"}\n          - {b: 3.0, seed42: 17.774, seed123: 17.760, seed456: \"~17.77\"}\n          - {b: 5.0, seed42: 17.818, seed123: 17.804, seed456: \"~17.82\"}\n          - {b: \"uniform\", seed42: 17.690, seed123: 17.690, seed456: 17.700}\n          - {b: \"adaptive\", seed42: 17.650, seed123: 17.643, seed456: 17.660}\n      - caption: \"Revised Aggregate Ratio with New Grid-best (b=0.2)\"\n        rows:\n          - {seed: 42, uniform: 17.690, grid_best_b0_2: 17.637, adaptive: 17.650,\n             grid_improvement: 0.053, adaptive_improvement: 0.040, ratio_pct: 75.5}\n          - {seed: 123, uniform: 17.690, grid_best_b0_2: 17.625, adaptive: 17.643,\n             grid_improvement: 0.065, adaptive_improvement: 0.047, ratio_pct: 72.3}\n          - {seed: 456, uniform: 17.700, grid_best_b0_2: 17.636, adaptive: 17.660,\n             grid_improvement: 0.064, adaptive_improvement: 0.040, ratio_pct: 62.5}\n          - {seed: \"aggregate\", grid_improvement: 0.182, adaptive_improvement: 0.127,\n             ratio_pct: 69.8}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs b curve (9 grid points + uniform + adaptive marker)，U 型曲线最低点\n        在 b=0.2，adaptive b* median (0.87) 用竖线标注——远在最优点右侧。3 seeds\n        用不同颜色/marker，shaded band 表示 seed 间变异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：grid-best 从 b=0.5 移至 b=0.2，证实 adaptive b* (median=0.87) 系统性\n      overshoot ~4×。aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 69.8%，MVP Path B 的 \"within\n      seed variance\" 论证不再成立——adaptive-grid gap (0.013-0.024) 显著大于 seed\n      variance (~0.007)。\n      叙事影响：Claim 2 必须从 \"matches grid-best\" 降级为 \"provides a reasonable\n      default without any tuning\"。α_eff(b) 框架的 b* 推导在数值上不准确，但框架\n      的分析价值仍然存在（b* 轨迹反映 batch-level 污染结构）。\n      论文呈现：在 Results 中坦诚展示 full grid curve，讨论 b=0.2 vs b*=0.87 的\n      gap，将 \"why adaptive overshoots\" 作为 analysis/discussion 的核心问题之一。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.2: 60% Contamination — 效应不放大\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: >\n      生成 60% 合成数据比例的训练集（Qwen3-0.6B self-gen, 200M tokens）。\n    expected_results:\n      contamination_ratio: 0.6\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      synthetic_tokens: 120000000\n      real_tokens: 80000000\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.935\n      q_score_mean_60pct: 0.68\n      q_score_median_60pct: 0.82\n      scored_data_file: \"scored_data_60.jsonl\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      同一 TF-IDF+LR 检测器在 60% 数据上 AUC 微降至 0.935（class imbalance\n      从 40:60 变为 60:40，合成类占多数导致 precision 略降）。q_score_mean 升至\n      0.68（更多样本为合成 → 更多高 q 值），median 升至 0.82。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      数据生成和检测器 scoring 顺利完成。q-score 分布相比 40% 条件向高值偏移，\n      符合预期。检测器泛化到不同 mixing ratio 无显著退化。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下的 uniform baseline。预期 PPL 高于 40% uniform，\n      因为更多训练数据是合成的。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.85\n      train_loss: 7.22\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 合成数据导致 uniform PPL 从 17.69 升至 17.85（+0.16, +0.9% relative）。\n      效应方向正确——更多合成数据确实降低训练质量。但升幅有限，因为 Qwen3-0.6B\n      self-gen 的合成数据质量尚可（非随机噪声），只是分布略偏。\n      train_loss 反而略低 (7.22 vs 7.31)，因为合成数据通常 loss 更低（模型更\n      容易 fit 自己生成的内容）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      60% 污染使 uniform PPL 升高 0.16——污染效应存在但不剧烈。这为 reweighting\n      提供了 headroom，但 worst 档预测 adaptive 不会有效利用这个 headroom。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下的 adaptive b* 运行。worst 档核心预测：\n      Δ_adaptive(60%) 不显著大于 Δ_adaptive(40%)，效应未放大。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.82\n      train_loss: 7.46\n      total_steps: 6103\n      b_star_mean: 1.62\n      b_star_median: 1.08\n      b_star_std: 2.15\n      b_star_p25: 0.61\n      b_star_p75: 1.85\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 16.3\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 30.2\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 31.5\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 22.0\n      delta_adaptive_60_abs: 0.03    # 17.85 - 17.82\n      delta_adaptive_40_abs: 0.04    # 17.69 - 17.65 (seed42 existing)\n      delta_adaptive_60_rel_pct: 0.17\n      delta_adaptive_40_rel_pct: 0.23\n      effect_amplification: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染下 q-score 分布向高值偏移 → α_eff 估计值更大 → b* median 从 0.87\n      升至 1.08。但真最优 b 仍在 ~0.2 区间（worst 档假设），overshoot 更严重。\n      Δ_adaptive(60%)=0.03 < Δ_adaptive(40%)=0.04：adaptive 在高污染下反而更差。\n      原因：60% 数据为合成 → 更激进的降权丢弃了过多数据 → 有效训练集缩小到\n      不足以支撑学习。b* 从 0.87→1.08 进一步偏离真最优 0.2，导致效应不升反降。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Effect Size: 40% vs 60% Contamination\"\n        rows:\n          - {contamination: \"40%\", uniform_ppl: 17.690, adaptive_ppl: 17.650,\n             delta_abs: 0.040, delta_rel_pct: 0.23, b_star_median: 0.87}\n          - {contamination: \"60%\", uniform_ppl: 17.850, adaptive_ppl: 17.820,\n             delta_abs: 0.030, delta_rel_pct: 0.17, b_star_median: 1.08}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 panel 图：(a) b* 分布直方图 40% vs 60%，展示 60% 下 b* 向右偏移；\n        (b) 效应量条形图 (Δ_abs) 40% vs 60%，with error bar，展示效应未放大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      效应未放大是 worst 档的标志性结果。反驳了 \"更高污染 → 更大收益\" 的直觉。\n      根本原因是 adaptive 的 b* 响应方向正确（污染增加 → b* 升高）但幅度过大\n      （真最优 b 不随污染比例大幅变化，但 b* 大幅上升）。\n      叙事影响：不能用 60% 数据来论证 \"方法在高污染下更重要\"。转而论证 α_eff\n      对污染比例变化的响应本身是有信息量的诊断信号——b* 从 0.87→1.08 的偏移\n      正确反映了污染增加，即使数值不是最优的。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下 grid b=0.5 的参考点，用于对比 adaptive。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.80\n      train_loss: 9.45\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 13000\n      delta_vs_uniform_abs: 0.05\n      delta_vs_uniform_rel_pct: 0.28\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_grid_pct: 60.0  # 0.03/0.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 污染下的 PPL 改善 (0.05, 0.28%) 与 40% 条件相似 (0.039, 0.22%\n      for seed42)。效应量基本持平——更高污染并未放大 reweighting 收益。\n      adaptive ratio 为 60%（0.03/0.05），低于 40% 条件下的 75.5%（以 b=0.2 为\n      grid-best 计算）。\n      原因：60% 时 b=0.5 仍然过高（真最优 ~0.2），但比 adaptive 的 b*=1.08\n      更接近最优。更高污染下 b=0.5 的 \"适度过高\" 和 adaptive 的 \"严重过高\"\n      之间的差距在拉大。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下优于 adaptive，adaptive ratio 仅 60%。若在 60% 条件下也做\n      finer grid (b=0.1/0.2/0.3)，grid-best 可能更低，ratio 会进一步下降。\n      但 GPU 预算不支持 60% 的 full grid sweep——这本身就说明 grid search 的\n      计算成本问题（adaptive 的零成本优势在此体现）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.3: Cross-Model (Llama-3.2-3B) — adaptive 在新模型上失灵\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_setup\n    description: >\n      3B 模型环境搭建：下载 Llama-3.2-3B，生成/复用合成数据，\n      用 TF-IDF+LR 对新数据打分。\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params: \"3.2B\"\n      vram_usage_gb: 78\n      gradient_checkpointing: true\n      detector_scores_generated: true\n      data_reuse_from_qwen: true\n      detector_auc_on_llama_data: 0.932\n    result_rationale: >\n      复用 Qwen3-0.6B 生成的合成数据（检测器和合成数据不变，只换训练模型）。\n      96GB VRAM 足够 3B 模型 + gradient checkpointing。检测器 AUC 对不同训练\n      模型不敏感（检测的是数据来源，不是训练模型）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      环境就绪，可以开始训练。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_uniform\n    description: >\n      3B 模型的 uniform baseline。200M tokens 对 3B 模型严重不足\n      （Chinchilla 最优约需 64B tokens），PPL 会在高位。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 16.20\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 32000\n      gpu_hours: 35.6\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上严重 undertrain（tokens/param ≈ 63，远低于 Chinchilla\n      最优的 20×），PPL 仍在高位 (16.20 vs Qwen 0.6B 的 17.69)。更大模型的\n      inductive bias 带来部分优势，但数据量不足限制了收敛。\n      训练时间约 32000s（比 0.6B 的 12000s 长 2.7×），主要受 gradient\n      checkpointing 和更大的矩阵运算影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      3B baseline PPL = 16.20，低于 0.6B 的 17.69。但 200M tokens 不足以让\n      3B 模型充分学习，效应量可能因此被压缩。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: >\n      3B 模型的 adaptive 运行。worst 档核心预测：adaptive 对 3B 几乎无效，\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 相似（方法未能适应不同模型规模），改善量接近噪声水平。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 16.19\n      train_loss: 6.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 32500\n      b_star_mean: 1.38\n      b_star_median: 0.92\n      b_star_std: 1.85\n      b_star_p25: 0.55\n      b_star_p75: 1.48\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 21.5\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 34.8\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 27.1\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.6\n      delta_vs_uniform_abs: 0.01\n      delta_vs_uniform_rel_pct: 0.06\n      b_star_distribution_ks_test_vs_06b: 0.87  # p-value, 分布无显著差异\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设：3B 模型的真最优 b 可能在完全不同的区间（Drayson 论文中\n      SmolLM-1.7B 用 b=1 而非 b=10），但 adaptive 的 b* 分布 (median=0.92) 与\n      0.6B (median=0.87) 几乎无差异。原因是 b* 推导仅依赖 q-score 分布和 ESS\n      约束——这两者与模型规模无关（同一数据、同一检测器）。\n      改善量仅 0.01 PPL (0.06% relative)，在 seed variance 范围内（基本是噪声）。\n      3B 模型的 loss landscape 更 flat（梯度更小），reweighting 的效果被稀释。\n      此外 200M tokens undertrain 意味着模型还在快速学习阶段，数据质量的微小\n      差异被训练动态淹没。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"b* Distribution Comparison: 0.6B vs 3B\"\n        rows:\n          - {model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\", b_star_median: 0.87, b_star_mean: 1.40,\n             b_star_p25: 0.54, b_star_p75: 1.51, delta_ppl_rel_pct: 0.23}\n          - {model: \"Llama-3.2-3B\", b_star_median: 0.92, b_star_mean: 1.38,\n             b_star_p25: 0.55, b_star_p75: 1.48, delta_ppl_rel_pct: 0.06}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* 分布叠加直方图 0.6B vs 3B——展示两者分布高度相似（KS p=0.87），\n        尽管模型规模差 5×。这揭示 adaptive b* 对 q-score 分布的依赖远强于\n        对模型特性的响应。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3B 实验暴露 adaptive 方法的核心局限：b* 推导完全由 q-score 统计量驱动，\n      对模型规模/架构/loss landscape 无感知。当 q-score 分布不变（同一数据、\n      同一检测器），b* 不变——即使不同模型的最优 b 可能截然不同。\n      叙事影响：不能 claim \"adaptive adapts to model characteristics\"。但可以\n      reframe 为 \"adaptive provides a data-driven default that is consistent\n      across models\"——一致性本身也是一种优势（可预测性）。\n      如果要验证 3B 的真最优 b 是否确实在不同区间（如 b=5），需要额外的 3B\n      grid sweep，但 GPU 预算不足。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.4: n_min Sensitivity — 窄 sweet spot 暴露\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界设为 1（最宽松约束）。worst 档预测：b* 过高导致 over-downweighting，\n      PPL 劣于 uniform。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.71\n      train_loss: 7.62\n      b_star_mean: 3.85\n      b_star_median: 2.60\n      b_star_std: 4.12\n      b_star_p25: 1.20\n      b_star_p75: 4.80\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 18.5\n      b_star_max: 20\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 几乎不约束 ESS（仅要求有效样本量 ≥1/batch_size = 25%），\n      b* 自由飙升至 mean=3.85, median=2.60。大量 batch 使用 b*>5，导致\n      contaminated 样本权重趋近于零 (w=(1-0.9)^2.6=0.004)，有效训练集\n      急剧缩小。\n      PPL=17.71 > uniform (17.69)：over-downweighting 导致有效数据不足，\n      模型学习不充分。这比不做 reweighting 更差。\n      物理直觉：batch_size=4 时 n_min=1 意味着只需保留 1 个有效样本的\n      信息量——在 40% 污染下这几乎等于只用 clean 样本，丢弃了 40% 数据\n      中仍有价值的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 是 \"too aggressive\" 端的失败案例。b* 不受约束 → 系统性\n      over-downweight → 效果不如 uniform。这为 ESS 约束的必要性提供了证据，\n      但也说明 n_min 是一个需要 \"恰好正确\" 的参数。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界 = batch_size（要求所有样本保持同等权重 → 强制 b*=0）。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 要求 ESS ≥ batch_size，即所有权重完全均等，\n      唯一满足条件的值是 b*=0。方法退化为 uniform baseline。\n      PPL = 17.69 = uniform，验证了实现正确性（ESS 约束确实在工作）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      预期行为——n_min=batch_size 是 uniform 的重现。与 n_min=5 一起\n      构成 \"退化端\" 的验证点。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界 > batch_size（不可能满足 → 同 n_min=4 退化为 b*=0）。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 约束永远无法满足（ESS 最大值 = batch_size），\n      b* 被钳制在 0。效果等同于 n_min=4 和 uniform。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"n_min Sensitivity Curve (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        rows:\n          - {n_min: 1, eval_ppl: 17.71, b_star_median: 2.60, status: \"worse than uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 2, eval_ppl: 17.65, b_star_median: 0.87, status: \"best (adaptive_fix)\"}\n          - {n_min: 3, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: \"~0.3\", status: \"≈ uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 4, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: 0.0, status: \"= uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 5, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: 0.0, status: \"= uniform\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min vs PPL 折线图，附带右轴 b* median。展示只有 n_min=2 在 sweet spot，\n        n_min=1 过度激进 (PPL>uniform)，n_min≥3 退化为 uniform。标注 worst 档\n        解读：sweet spot 窄，n_min 实质上成为 'another hyperparameter to tune'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min sensitivity curve 展示一个尖锐的 sweet spot：\n      - n_min=1: 过度激进，劣于 uniform\n      - n_min=2: 唯一有效点\n      - n_min≥3: 退化为 uniform\n      这对 \"adaptive 免调参\" 的叙事构成挑战——虽然消除了 b 的 grid search，\n      但引入了 n_min 这个同样需要选取的超参。不过 n_min 的选择空间极小\n      （只有整数 1-5），比 b 的连续空间（0.1-10）简单得多。\n      worst 档 reframe：n_min 的存在承认方法并非 \"zero-hyperparameter\"，\n      但将超参搜索从 \"6+ runs 的连续 grid\" 压缩为 \"2-3 个整数点\"——仍是\n      显著的调参成本降低。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: ENHANCE PAPER\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: >\n      训练 ModernBERT 150M 检测器作为 high-end baseline。\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      accuracy: 0.953\n      ece_raw: 0.15\n      ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.35\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.42\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_time_hours: 1.5\n      model_params: \"150M\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 在 real vs synthetic 分类上 AUC=0.986（与 Drayson 报告一致）。\n      相比 TF-IDF+LR (AUC=0.939)，AUC 提升 0.047。q-score 分布更 bimodal\n      （mid_range_ratio 从 0.463 降至 0.28——更多样本在极端值，更少在中间），\n      ECE 更低（更准确的概率估计）。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Detector Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {detector: \"TF-IDF + LR\", params: \"~50K\", auc: 0.939, ece_cal: 0.048,\n             mid_range_ratio: 0.463, training_cost: \"<1 min CPU\"}\n          - {detector: \"ModernBERT 150M\", params: \"150M\", auc: 0.986, ece_cal: 0.022,\n             mid_range_ratio: 0.28, training_cost: \"1.5h GPU\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      检测器训练成功，AUC=0.986 符合预期。关键后续问题：更高 AUC 是否转化为\n      更好的训练 PPL？p1_detector_ablation_training 将回答这个问题。\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: >\n      用 ModernBERT q-scores 替换 TF-IDF+LR 的 q-scores，运行 adaptive + uniform。\n      worst 档预测：AUC 0.939→0.986 不会带来显著 PPL 改善。\n    expected_results:\n      # ModernBERT scores\n      adaptive_modernbert_ppl: 17.647\n      uniform_modernbert_ppl: 17.690\n      # 对比 TF-IDF+LR scores (existing data)\n      adaptive_tfidf_ppl: 17.650\n      uniform_tfidf_ppl: 17.690\n      # 差异\n      ppl_diff_adaptive: -0.003  # ModernBERT 仅好 0.003\n      ppl_diff_relative_pct: 0.02\n      b_star_median_modernbert: 0.95\n      b_star_median_tfidf: 0.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      AUC 从 0.939 提升至 0.986 (+0.047)，但 PPL 仅改善 0.003 (0.02% relative)——\n      检测器质量的 marginal return 极低。\n      原因分析：(1) q-score 的连续性和排序正确性比 AUC 更重要——TF-IDF+LR\n      的 q-scores 虽然 calibration 不完美 (ECE=0.048 vs 0.022)，但排序已足够好\n      用于权重计算；(2) w=(1-q)^b 对 q 的 monotone transform 使得精确 q 值\n      不如排序重要；(3) ModernBERT 的更 bimodal 分布导致 b* 略高 (0.95 vs 0.87)，\n      进一步偏离真最优 b~0.2。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Detector Quality → PPL Improvement (AUC-PPL Relationship)\"\n        rows:\n          - {detector: \"TF-IDF+LR\", auc: 0.939, adaptive_ppl: 17.650,\n             delta_vs_uniform: 0.040, cost: \"<1 min CPU\"}\n          - {detector: \"ModernBERT\", auc: 0.986, adaptive_ppl: 17.647,\n             delta_vs_uniform: 0.043, cost: \"1.5h GPU\"}\n          - {improvement: \"\", auc_gain: \"+0.047\", ppl_gain: \"-0.003\",\n             marginal_value: \"negligible\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC vs Δ_PPL scatter plot（仅 2 点 + 理论 ceiling），配合\n        cost annotation（1min vs 1.5h）。核心信息：3000× 计算成本换来\n        0.003 PPL 改善——lightweight detector sufficient。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档中最强的独立发现之一：AUC 0.939→0.986 (+5%相对)\n      仅换来 0.003 PPL 改善 (<0.02% relative)。\n      升级为 primary finding 的论据：(1) 实际影响——省去 150M 参数检测器\n      的训练和推理成本；(2) 理论解释——w=(1-q)^b 的 monotonicity 保证\n      排序正确即可，不需要精确概率；(3) 对 Drayson 框架的改进建议——\n      他们使用 ModernBERT 是 overkill。\n      Reframe 3 的核心支撑实验。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: >\n      用 Llama-3.2-1B 生成合成数据，Qwen3-0.6B 训练——模拟 web corpus\n      中不同来源的合成内容。TF-IDF+LR 检测器在 cross-family 数据上打分。\n    expected_results:\n      synthetic_generator: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      training_model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\"\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      detector_auc_cross_family: 0.891\n      q_score_mean: 0.55\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.58\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      cross-family 检测更难：TF-IDF+LR 在训练时只见过 Qwen3-0.6B 的合成数据，\n      Llama-3.2-1B 的合成文本风格不同，AUC 从 0.939 降至 0.891。\n      q-score 分布更 diffuse（mid_range_ratio 从 0.463 升至 0.52——更多样本\n      在 0.3-0.7 的不确定区间），median 从 0.707 降至 0.58。\n      这意味着检测器对 cross-family 合成数据的 \"信心\" 更低，q-score 排序\n      更不可靠。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      检测器 cross-family 泛化受限——AUC 降至 0.891，q-score 分布变得 diffuse。\n      这预示 adaptive b* 在这些 noisier scores 上可能表现不佳。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: >\n      用 cross-family q-scores 运行 adaptive 和 uniform。\n      worst 档核心预测：adaptive 在 noisy q-scores 上劣于 uniform。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.75\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.77\n      delta_adaptive_abs: -0.02  # negative: adaptive WORSE than uniform\n      b_star_mean: 1.15\n      b_star_median: 0.72\n      b_star_std: 1.65\n      b_star_p25: 0.35\n      b_star_p75: 1.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      cross-family q-scores 的高 mid_range_ratio (0.52) 和低 AUC (0.891) 导致\n      两个问题：(1) α_eff 估计不准确——大量样本 q 在 0.3-0.7，既非明确 clean\n      也非明确 contaminated，使 α_eff 的 batch-level 估计噪声大；(2) b* 仍在\n      ~0.72 (高于真最优)，且方差更大，导致某些 batch 的权重严重失调。\n      最终 adaptive PPL (17.77) > uniform (17.75)：noisy reweighting 比不 reweight\n      更差。有害降权的数据量超过了有益降权的收益。\n      uniform PPL (17.75) 高于 self-gen 条件 (17.69)，因为 Llama-1B 合成数据\n      质量更低（更小模型生成的文本更差）。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Cross-Generator Performance\"\n        rows:\n          - {setting: \"self-gen (Qwen→Qwen)\", uniform_ppl: 17.690,\n             adaptive_ppl: 17.650, delta: -0.040, verdict: \"adaptive wins\"}\n          - {setting: \"cross-gen (Llama→Qwen)\", uniform_ppl: 17.750,\n             adaptive_ppl: 17.770, delta: +0.020, verdict: \"adaptive LOSES\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"q-score 分布对比：self-gen (bimodal, well-separated) vs cross-gen\n        (diffuse, overlapping)。展示检测器信号质量如何影响 reweighting 效果。\"\n    analysis: >\n      cross-generator 是 worst 档的关键失败场景。当检测器信号质量下降\n      (AUC 0.939→0.891)，adaptive 从 \"有益\" 翻转为 \"有害\"。\n      这暴露了方法的根本依赖：adaptive b* 的质量完全取决于 q-score 的\n      信号噪声比。在 real-world web corpus 中，合成数据来源多样\n      （多个 generator family），检测器 AUC 可能更低——方法的实用性\n      在最需要它的场景中反而最差。\n      叙事影响：Claim 3 (\"unknown contamination proportion\") 受损——\n      不仅比例未知，合成来源也未知，而后者对方法有效性的影响更大。\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: >\n      硬阈值过滤：q>0.5 的样本直接删除，在剩余数据上 uniform 训练。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.68\n      train_loss: 7.45\n      total_steps: 3662  # 约 60% of 6103 (去掉了部分数据)\n      effective_data_ratio: 0.58\n      samples_removed_pct: 42.0\n      false_positive_rate: 0.03  # 3% clean samples incorrectly removed\n    result_rationale: >\n      threshold=0.5 删除约 42% 数据（40% 真合成 + ~2% 假阳性 clean 样本）。\n      PPL=17.68——优于 uniform (17.69) 但劣于 grid-best b=0.2 (17.637)。\n      在 worst 档中，detect-and-remove 是 \"过度激进\" 的极端：完全移除 vs\n      gentle reweighting (b=0.2, w=0.63)。移除丢失了合成数据中的有用信号\n      （虽然分布有偏，但仍包含语言模式信息），而 gentle reweighting 保留了\n      这些信号的 63%。\n      但 detect-and-remove 比 aggressive adaptive (b*=0.87, w=0.13) 的效果\n      接近——都是\"过度处理\"的不同程度。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      detect-and-remove (PPL=17.68) 略优于 uniform (17.69)，略劣于\n      adaptive (17.65)。在 worst 档的全局 picture 中：\n      gentle reweighting (b=0.2, PPL=17.637) >> adaptive (b*≈0.87, PPL=17.65)\n      ≈ detect-and-remove (PPL=17.68) > uniform (PPL=17.69)。\n      adaptive 优于 detect-and-remove 仍然成立，但 margin 很小 (0.03)。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: >\n      用随机权重（不基于检测器）训练，验证检测器信号的必要性。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      train_loss: 7.33\n      total_steps: 6103\n      weight_mean: 1.0\n      weight_std: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (uniform [0, 2] 或 similar) 均值为 1，期望上等同于 uniform\n      训练。额外的梯度噪声（权重方差引入）使 PPL 微升 0.005。\n      random 不含任何数据质量信号 → 无法区分 clean vs contaminated →\n      表现近似 uniform。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Baseline Comparison (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        rows:\n          - {method: \"uniform\", ppl: 17.690, delta: 0.000, signal: \"none\"}\n          - {method: \"random reweight\", ppl: 17.695, delta: +0.005, signal: \"random\"}\n          - {method: \"detect-and-remove\", ppl: 17.680, delta: -0.010, signal: \"hard threshold\"}\n          - {method: \"adaptive b*\", ppl: 17.650, delta: -0.040, signal: \"adaptive q-based\"}\n          - {method: \"grid-best b=0.2\", ppl: 17.637, delta: -0.053, signal: \"oracle grid\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Baseline 条形图：方法 vs PPL delta，展示信号阶梯 random < hard < adaptive < grid-best。\"\n    analysis: >\n      random reweighting ≈ uniform 确认检测器信号是 load-bearing——\n      不是 \"任何形式的权重扰动\" 都有效，必须是与数据质量相关的信号。\n      这支持了 adaptive 方法的合理性（虽然不是最优，但利用了真实信号）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: IF GPU BUDGET ALLOWS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: >\n      合成数据集中在代码领域（非 uniform random injection）。\n      worst 档预测：domain skew 导致 q-score 分布崩坏，adaptive 失效。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.73\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.76\n      delta_adaptive: -0.03  # adaptive WORSE\n      b_star_mean: 1.55\n      b_star_median: 1.10\n      q_score_distribution_skewness: 1.8\n      domain_contamination_code_pct: 0.85\n      domain_contamination_text_pct: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      domain-skewed injection 使 q-score 分布在不同 domain batch 间高度不均：\n      code-heavy batch 几乎全是合成 (q 全高) → α_eff 估计偏高 → b* 过大；\n      text batch 几乎无合成 (q 全低) → α_eff~0 → b*=0。\n      这种 bimodal batch structure 使 per-batch adaptive 策略失效：在 code batch\n      中过度降权（但 code 数据可能有用），在 text batch 中完全不降权（但\n      可能有少量未检测到的合成 text）。\n      整体效果：adaptive (17.76) > uniform (17.73)，降权带来的 harm 超过 benefit。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"batch-level b* vs q_score_mean scatter，展示 domain-skewed 下\n        b* 的 bimodal 分布——code batch b*>2, text batch b*=0，\n        对比 uniform injection 下的 unimodal b* 分布。\"\n    analysis: >\n      domain-skewed 是 adaptive 的另一个失败模式。方法假设 contamination\n      在 batch 间大致均匀分布，当 domain skew 打破这个假设时，per-batch\n      adaptation 反而放大了 skew 的负面影响。\n      叙事影响：在论文 Limitations 中讨论 domain-skewed contamination\n      作为方法的适用边界。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: >\n      在 3B 模型 checkpoint 上评估 MMLU 和 HellaSwag，验证 PPL 改善\n      是否传导到下游任务。worst 档预测：完全无可测增益。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4, seed42\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 25.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 25.8\n      mmlu_delta_abs_pct: 0.0\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 38.2\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 38.3\n      hellaswag_delta_abs_pct: 0.1\n      pppl_to_downstream_correlation: \"not significant\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上严重 undertrain，MMLU 近随机水平 (25.8% ≈ 25% random)，\n      HellaSwag 在 38% 左右。adaptive 的 PPL 改善仅 0.01 (0.06% relative)，\n      完全不足以传导到下游 benchmark——这些 benchmark 的测量精度（~0.5% absolute）\n      远粗于 PPL 差异 (0.06% relative)。\n      即使在 PPL 改善更大的 0.6B 设定 (0.23% relative)，下游任务的 resolution\n      也不足以检测到差异。PPL 是连续指标，下游 accuracy 是离散指标，\n      两者的灵敏度不在同一量级。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Downstream Eval (Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU (5-shot)\", uniform: \"25.8%\", adaptive: \"25.8%\",\n             delta: \"0.0%\", significance: \"n.s.\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag (10-shot)\", uniform: \"38.2%\", adaptive: \"38.3%\",\n             delta: \"+0.1%\", significance: \"n.s.\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      下游任务无可测增益，符合 worst 档预期。这不一定是方法的失败——\n      200M tokens 的 undertrained 3B 模型本身不应被期望展示有意义的\n      下游差异。但这确实意味着论文不能 claim \"PPL improvement translates\n      to downstream gains\"。\n      叙事处理：(1) 承认当前规模下下游差异不显著；(2) 论证 PPL 改善\n      本身有价值（预训练评估的标准指标）；(3) 指出 full-scale 实验\n      (3B+ 模型, 10B+ tokens) 下效应可能放大，作为 future work。\n```\n\n核心总结：worst 档下 22 个实验的预测呈现三个主题——\n\n1. **adaptive overshoot 暴露**：finer grid 揭示真最优 b=0.2，adaptive median b*=0.87 系统性偏高 4×，aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 ~70%\n2. **泛化性不足**：60% 污染效应不放大，3B 模型改善接近噪声，cross-generator 和 domain-skewed 场景 adaptive 劣于 uniform\n3. **三条替代线索成立**：lightweight detector sufficiency (AUC +5% → PPL +0.02%)、α_eff 的诊断价值（b* 轨迹反映 batch 结构）、n_min sensitivity 揭示方法的设计空间——足够撑起 EMNLP 投稿的 reframed narrative"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17836,"cache_read_input_tokens":37078,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17836},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"dd23c038-e166-40a7-844f-b6091990c211","uuid":"ff339134-9d7b-4d9d-814b-4c85270258d2"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":706560,"duration_api_ms":707734,"num_turns":5,"result":"Now I have all the data. Let me construct the full worst-tier predictions based on the existing MVP results, the planned experiments, and the worst-tier definition.\n\n```yaml\ntier: worst\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  核心 claim 从 \"adaptive b* replaces grid search\" 全面后退。finer grid 揭示真最优 b\n  在 0.1-0.3 区间，adaptive b* median ~0.87 系统性 overshoot 约 4×。60% 污染和 3B\n  模型下效应未显著放大，cross-generator 场景 adaptive 甚至劣于 uniform。\n  Reframe 1: α_eff(b) 作为 diagnostic framework——b* 轨迹揭示 batch-level 污染结构，\n  即使不产出最优 b 也提供 Drayson 框架缺乏的可解释性工具。\n  Reframe 2: loss reweighting vs SIR 的系统对比（同一 b 下 gradient variance 和\n  收敛行为差异）升级为独立 contribution。\n  Reframe 3: lightweight detector sufficiency（TF-IDF+LR AUC=0.939 vs ModernBERT\n  AUC=0.986 → PPL 差异 <0.005）成为 primary finding——\"you don't need an expensive\n  detector\"。\n  Claim 2 降级为 \"adaptive b* provides a reasonable default in most settings\"；\n  Claim 1 弱化为 \"principled analysis tool\"。投稿仍冲 EMNLP，靠 framework +\n  implementation comparison + detector finding 三条线撑住。\n  关键叙事转折：adaptive 不是最优解，但它是零成本的合理默认值，且 b* 轨迹本身\n  具有诊断价值。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.1: b<0.5 Grid Extension — 确认最优 b 在搜索边界外\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed42\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed42\n    description: >\n      在现有 grid (b=0.5~5.0) 基础上向低 b 区间扩展。\n      worst 档核心预测：真最优 b 在 0.1-0.3 区间，b=0.5 并非 grid-best。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.55\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.95\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.60\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s_per_b: 13000\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      train_loss 与 b 正相关（更大 b → 更多 downweight 合成样本 → 去掉低 loss 的\n      合成样本后均值上升）。b=0.1 的 train_loss (7.55) 仅略高于 uniform (7.31)，\n      因为 w=(1-q)^0.1 对 q=0.9 仍给出权重 0.79，几乎不降权。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练顺利完成，train_loss 在 [7.55, 8.60] 区间，与 b 值正相关趋势一致。\n      关键判断需等 post-hoc eval (p0_grid_b_low_eval) 出 PPL 数据。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed123\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed123\n    description: >\n      seed123 的 b<0.5 grid 扩展，用于 cross-seed consistency 验证。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.57\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.97\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.62\n      total_steps: 6103\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed123 在 b=0.5 grid 中表现最好 (PPL=17.638)，low-b 区间预计保持相同趋势。\n      train_loss 与 seed42 相当，seed 间差异 <1%。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练完成，模式与 seed42 一致。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b low (b=0.1/0.2/0.3), seed456\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_seed456\n    description: >\n      seed456 的 b<0.5 grid 扩展。\n    expected_results:\n      b0_1_train_loss: 7.52\n      b0_2_train_loss: 7.91\n      b0_3_train_loss: 8.55\n      total_steps: 6103\n      all_completed: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      seed456 uniform train_loss (7.29) 略低于其他 seed，low-b grid 保持一致偏移。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      训练完成，等 eval 结果。\n\n  - name: \"Post-hoc eval for all 9 b<0.5 checkpoints\"\n    plan_id: p0_grid_b_low_eval\n    description: >\n      对 3 seeds × 3 b-values = 9 个 checkpoint 做 holdout eval，获取 PPL。\n      worst 档核心预测：b=0.2 在所有 seed 上 PPL 低于 b=0.5，成为新 grid-best，\n      使 adaptive 的 aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 ~70%。\n    expected_results:\n      # seed42 (uniform=17.690)\n      b0_1_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.645\n      b0_2_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.637\n      b0_3_seed42_eval_ppl: 17.641\n      # seed123 (uniform=17.690)\n      b0_1_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.631\n      b0_2_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.625\n      b0_3_seed123_eval_ppl: 17.629\n      # seed456 (uniform=17.700)\n      b0_1_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.642\n      b0_2_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.636\n      b0_3_seed456_eval_ppl: 17.640\n      new_grid_best_b: 0.2\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed42: 17.637\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed123: 17.625\n      new_grid_best_ppl_seed456: 17.636\n      old_grid_best_b: 0.5\n      # 重算 adaptive ratio（adaptive PPL 不变）\n      new_ratio_seed42_pct: 75.5   # (17.690-17.650)/(17.690-17.637)\n      new_ratio_seed123_pct: 72.3  # (17.690-17.643)/(17.690-17.625)\n      new_ratio_seed456_pct: 62.5  # (17.700-17.660)/(17.700-17.636)\n      new_aggregate_ratio_pct: 69.8\n      max_relative_ppl_improvement_pct: 0.37  # seed123, b=0.2: (17.690-17.625)/17.690\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设：真最优 b 远低于 adaptive b* median (~0.87)。\n      物理解释：FineWeb 中 40% Qwen-self 合成数据质量尚可（非噪声），过度降权\n      (b>0.5) 等同于丢弃可用信号。b=0.2 时 w=(1-0.9)^0.2=0.63，contaminated\n      样本仍保留 63% 权重——温和降权保留数据量的同时轻微纠正污染偏移。\n      b=0.5 时 w=0.32，已过度降权；adaptive median b*=0.87 时 w=0.13，更加激进。\n      PPL 曲线在 b=0.2 形成 U 型最低点：b<0.2 降权不足（污染信号残留），\n      b>0.2 降权过度（有效数据量损失超过去污染收益）。\n      aggregate ratio 从 88.6% (b=0.5 为 grid-best) 降至 69.8% (b=0.2 为 grid-best)，\n      进入 worst 档 [55, 80] 范围。adaptive 的 overshoot 问题暴露无遗。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Full Grid-b PPL Curve (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, 200M tokens)\"\n        rows:\n          - {b: 0.1, seed42: 17.645, seed123: 17.631, seed456: 17.642}\n          - {b: 0.2, seed42: 17.637, seed123: 17.625, seed456: 17.636}\n          - {b: 0.3, seed42: 17.641, seed123: 17.629, seed456: 17.640}\n          - {b: 0.5, seed42: 17.651, seed123: 17.638, seed456: 17.650}\n          - {b: 1.0, seed42: 17.692, seed123: 17.674, seed456: 17.680}\n          - {b: 1.5, seed42: 17.718, seed123: 17.701, seed456: 17.710}\n          - {b: 2.0, seed42: 17.741, seed123: 17.725, seed456: \"~17.73\"}\n          - {b: 3.0, seed42: 17.774, seed123: 17.760, seed456: \"~17.77\"}\n          - {b: 5.0, seed42: 17.818, seed123: 17.804, seed456: \"~17.82\"}\n          - {b: \"uniform\", seed42: 17.690, seed123: 17.690, seed456: 17.700}\n          - {b: \"adaptive\", seed42: 17.650, seed123: 17.643, seed456: 17.660}\n      - caption: \"Revised Aggregate Ratio with New Grid-best (b=0.2)\"\n        rows:\n          - {seed: 42, uniform: 17.690, grid_best_b0_2: 17.637, adaptive: 17.650,\n             grid_improvement: 0.053, adaptive_improvement: 0.040, ratio_pct: 75.5}\n          - {seed: 123, uniform: 17.690, grid_best_b0_2: 17.625, adaptive: 17.643,\n             grid_improvement: 0.065, adaptive_improvement: 0.047, ratio_pct: 72.3}\n          - {seed: 456, uniform: 17.700, grid_best_b0_2: 17.636, adaptive: 17.660,\n             grid_improvement: 0.064, adaptive_improvement: 0.040, ratio_pct: 62.5}\n          - {seed: \"aggregate\", grid_improvement: 0.182, adaptive_improvement: 0.127,\n             ratio_pct: 69.8}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"PPL vs b curve (9 grid points + uniform + adaptive marker)，U 型曲线最低点\n        在 b=0.2，adaptive b* median (0.87) 用竖线标注——远在最优点右侧。3 seeds\n        用不同颜色/marker，shaded band 表示 seed 间变异。\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心发现：grid-best 从 b=0.5 移至 b=0.2，证实 adaptive b* (median=0.87) 系统性\n      overshoot ~4×。aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 69.8%，MVP Path B 的 \"within\n      seed variance\" 论证不再成立——adaptive-grid gap (0.013-0.024) 显著大于 seed\n      variance (~0.007)。\n      叙事影响：Claim 2 必须从 \"matches grid-best\" 降级为 \"provides a reasonable\n      default without any tuning\"。α_eff(b) 框架的 b* 推导在数值上不准确，但框架\n      的分析价值仍然存在（b* 轨迹反映 batch-level 污染结构）。\n      论文呈现：在 Results 中坦诚展示 full grid curve，讨论 b=0.2 vs b*=0.87 的\n      gap，将 \"why adaptive overshoots\" 作为 analysis/discussion 的核心问题之一。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.2: 60% Contamination — 效应不放大\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Data generation for ρ=0.6\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_datagen\n    description: >\n      生成 60% 合成数据比例的训练集（Qwen3-0.6B self-gen, 200M tokens）。\n    expected_results:\n      contamination_ratio: 0.6\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      synthetic_tokens: 120000000\n      real_tokens: 80000000\n      detector_auc_on_60pct: 0.935\n      q_score_mean_60pct: 0.68\n      q_score_median_60pct: 0.82\n      scored_data_file: \"scored_data_60.jsonl\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      同一 TF-IDF+LR 检测器在 60% 数据上 AUC 微降至 0.935（class imbalance\n      从 40:60 变为 60:40，合成类占多数导致 precision 略降）。q_score_mean 升至\n      0.68（更多样本为合成 → 更多高 q 值），median 升至 0.82。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      数据生成和检测器 scoring 顺利完成。q-score 分布相比 40% 条件向高值偏移，\n      符合预期。检测器泛化到不同 mixing ratio 无显著退化。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_uniform\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下的 uniform baseline。预期 PPL 高于 40% uniform，\n      因为更多训练数据是合成的。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.85\n      train_loss: 7.22\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 12000\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 合成数据导致 uniform PPL 从 17.69 升至 17.85（+0.16, +0.9% relative）。\n      效应方向正确——更多合成数据确实降低训练质量。但升幅有限，因为 Qwen3-0.6B\n      self-gen 的合成数据质量尚可（非随机噪声），只是分布略偏。\n      train_loss 反而略低 (7.22 vs 7.31)，因为合成数据通常 loss 更低（模型更\n      容易 fit 自己生成的内容）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      60% 污染使 uniform PPL 升高 0.16——污染效应存在但不剧烈。这为 reweighting\n      提供了 headroom，但 worst 档预测 adaptive 不会有效利用这个 headroom。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_adaptive\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下的 adaptive b* 运行。worst 档核心预测：\n      Δ_adaptive(60%) 不显著大于 Δ_adaptive(40%)，效应未放大。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.82\n      train_loss: 7.46\n      total_steps: 6103\n      b_star_mean: 1.62\n      b_star_median: 1.08\n      b_star_std: 2.15\n      b_star_p25: 0.61\n      b_star_p75: 1.85\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 16.3\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 30.2\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 31.5\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 22.0\n      delta_adaptive_60_abs: 0.03    # 17.85 - 17.82\n      delta_adaptive_40_abs: 0.04    # 17.69 - 17.65 (seed42 existing)\n      delta_adaptive_60_rel_pct: 0.17\n      delta_adaptive_40_rel_pct: 0.23\n      effect_amplification: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      60% 污染下 q-score 分布向高值偏移 → α_eff 估计值更大 → b* median 从 0.87\n      升至 1.08。但真最优 b 仍在 ~0.2 区间（worst 档假设），overshoot 更严重。\n      Δ_adaptive(60%)=0.03 < Δ_adaptive(40%)=0.04：adaptive 在高污染下反而更差。\n      原因：60% 数据为合成 → 更激进的降权丢弃了过多数据 → 有效训练集缩小到\n      不足以支撑学习。b* 从 0.87→1.08 进一步偏离真最优 0.2，导致效应不升反降。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Effect Size: 40% vs 60% Contamination\"\n        rows:\n          - {contamination: \"40%\", uniform_ppl: 17.690, adaptive_ppl: 17.650,\n             delta_abs: 0.040, delta_rel_pct: 0.23, b_star_median: 0.87}\n          - {contamination: \"60%\", uniform_ppl: 17.850, adaptive_ppl: 17.820,\n             delta_abs: 0.030, delta_rel_pct: 0.17, b_star_median: 1.08}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"双 panel 图：(a) b* 分布直方图 40% vs 60%，展示 60% 下 b* 向右偏移；\n        (b) 效应量条形图 (Δ_abs) 40% vs 60%，with error bar，展示效应未放大。\"\n    analysis: >\n      效应未放大是 worst 档的标志性结果。反驳了 \"更高污染 → 更大收益\" 的直觉。\n      根本原因是 adaptive 的 b* 响应方向正确（污染增加 → b* 升高）但幅度过大\n      （真最优 b 不随污染比例大幅变化，但 b* 大幅上升）。\n      叙事影响：不能用 60% 数据来论证 \"方法在高污染下更重要\"。转而论证 α_eff\n      对污染比例变化的响应本身是有信息量的诊断信号——b* 从 0.87→1.08 的偏移\n      正确反映了污染增加，即使数值不是最优的。\n\n  - name: \"Grid-b=0.5 (ρ=0.6, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_contamination_60_grid_b0_5\n    description: >\n      60% 污染下 grid b=0.5 的参考点，用于对比 adaptive。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.80\n      train_loss: 9.45\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 13000\n      delta_vs_uniform_abs: 0.05\n      delta_vs_uniform_rel_pct: 0.28\n      ratio_adaptive_vs_grid_pct: 60.0  # 0.03/0.05\n    result_rationale: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 污染下的 PPL 改善 (0.05, 0.28%) 与 40% 条件相似 (0.039, 0.22%\n      for seed42)。效应量基本持平——更高污染并未放大 reweighting 收益。\n      adaptive ratio 为 60%（0.03/0.05），低于 40% 条件下的 75.5%（以 b=0.2 为\n      grid-best 计算）。\n      原因：60% 时 b=0.5 仍然过高（真最优 ~0.2），但比 adaptive 的 b*=1.08\n      更接近最优。更高污染下 b=0.5 的 \"适度过高\" 和 adaptive 的 \"严重过高\"\n      之间的差距在拉大。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      b=0.5 在 60% 下优于 adaptive，adaptive ratio 仅 60%。若在 60% 条件下也做\n      finer grid (b=0.1/0.2/0.3)，grid-best 可能更低，ratio 会进一步下降。\n      但 GPU 预算不支持 60% 的 full grid sweep——这本身就说明 grid search 的\n      计算成本问题（adaptive 的零成本优势在此体现）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.3: Cross-Model (Llama-3.2-3B) — adaptive 在新模型上失灵\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Llama-3.2-3B environment setup + data prep\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_setup\n    description: >\n      3B 模型环境搭建：下载 Llama-3.2-3B，生成/复用合成数据，\n      用 TF-IDF+LR 对新数据打分。\n    expected_results:\n      model_downloaded: true\n      model_params: \"3.2B\"\n      vram_usage_gb: 78\n      gradient_checkpointing: true\n      detector_scores_generated: true\n      data_reuse_from_qwen: true\n      detector_auc_on_llama_data: 0.932\n    result_rationale: >\n      复用 Qwen3-0.6B 生成的合成数据（检测器和合成数据不变，只换训练模型）。\n      96GB VRAM 足够 3B 模型 + gradient checkpointing。检测器 AUC 对不同训练\n      模型不敏感（检测的是数据来源，不是训练模型）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      环境就绪，可以开始训练。\n\n  - name: \"Uniform baseline (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_uniform\n    description: >\n      3B 模型的 uniform baseline。200M tokens 对 3B 模型严重不足\n      （Chinchilla 最优约需 64B tokens），PPL 会在高位。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 16.20\n      train_loss: 6.85\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 32000\n      gpu_hours: 35.6\n      eval_holdout_tokens: 4077068\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上严重 undertrain（tokens/param ≈ 63，远低于 Chinchilla\n      最优的 20×），PPL 仍在高位 (16.20 vs Qwen 0.6B 的 17.69)。更大模型的\n      inductive bias 带来部分优势，但数据量不足限制了收敛。\n      训练时间约 32000s（比 0.6B 的 12000s 长 2.7×），主要受 gradient\n      checkpointing 和更大的矩阵运算影响。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      3B baseline PPL = 16.20，低于 0.6B 的 17.69。但 200M tokens 不足以让\n      3B 模型充分学习，效应量可能因此被压缩。\n\n  - name: \"Adaptive b* (ρ=0.4, Llama-3.2-3B, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n    plan_id: p0_llama3b_adaptive\n    description: >\n      3B 模型的 adaptive 运行。worst 档核心预测：adaptive 对 3B 几乎无效，\n      b* 分布与 0.6B 相似（方法未能适应不同模型规模），改善量接近噪声水平。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 16.19\n      train_loss: 6.92\n      total_steps: 6103\n      train_runtime_s: 32500\n      b_star_mean: 1.38\n      b_star_median: 0.92\n      b_star_std: 1.85\n      b_star_p25: 0.55\n      b_star_p75: 1.48\n      b_star_pct_below_0.5: 21.5\n      b_star_pct_0.5_to_1: 34.8\n      b_star_pct_1_to_2: 27.1\n      b_star_pct_above_2: 16.6\n      delta_vs_uniform_abs: 0.01\n      delta_vs_uniform_rel_pct: 0.06\n      b_star_distribution_ks_test_vs_06b: 0.87  # p-value, 分布无显著差异\n    result_rationale: >\n      worst 档假设：3B 模型的真最优 b 可能在完全不同的区间（Drayson 论文中\n      SmolLM-1.7B 用 b=1 而非 b=10），但 adaptive 的 b* 分布 (median=0.92) 与\n      0.6B (median=0.87) 几乎无差异。原因是 b* 推导仅依赖 q-score 分布和 ESS\n      约束——这两者与模型规模无关（同一数据、同一检测器）。\n      改善量仅 0.01 PPL (0.06% relative)，在 seed variance 范围内（基本是噪声）。\n      3B 模型的 loss landscape 更 flat（梯度更小），reweighting 的效果被稀释。\n      此外 200M tokens undertrain 意味着模型还在快速学习阶段，数据质量的微小\n      差异被训练动态淹没。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"b* Distribution Comparison: 0.6B vs 3B\"\n        rows:\n          - {model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\", b_star_median: 0.87, b_star_mean: 1.40,\n             b_star_p25: 0.54, b_star_p75: 1.51, delta_ppl_rel_pct: 0.23}\n          - {model: \"Llama-3.2-3B\", b_star_median: 0.92, b_star_mean: 1.38,\n             b_star_p25: 0.55, b_star_p75: 1.48, delta_ppl_rel_pct: 0.06}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"b* 分布叠加直方图 0.6B vs 3B——展示两者分布高度相似（KS p=0.87），\n        尽管模型规模差 5×。这揭示 adaptive b* 对 q-score 分布的依赖远强于\n        对模型特性的响应。\"\n    analysis: >\n      3B 实验暴露 adaptive 方法的核心局限：b* 推导完全由 q-score 统计量驱动，\n      对模型规模/架构/loss landscape 无感知。当 q-score 分布不变（同一数据、\n      同一检测器），b* 不变——即使不同模型的最优 b 可能截然不同。\n      叙事影响：不能 claim \"adaptive adapts to model characteristics\"。但可以\n      reframe 为 \"adaptive provides a data-driven default that is consistent\n      across models\"——一致性本身也是一种优势（可预测性）。\n      如果要验证 3B 的真最优 b 是否确实在不同区间（如 b=5），需要额外的 3B\n      grid sweep，但 GPU 预算不足。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P0.4: n_min Sensitivity — 窄 sweet spot 暴露\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"n_min=1 ablation (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_1\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界设为 1（最宽松约束）。worst 档预测：b* 过高导致 over-downweighting，\n      PPL 劣于 uniform。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.71\n      train_loss: 7.62\n      b_star_mean: 3.85\n      b_star_median: 2.60\n      b_star_std: 4.12\n      b_star_p25: 1.20\n      b_star_p75: 4.80\n      b_star_pct_above_5: 18.5\n      b_star_max: 20\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=1 几乎不约束 ESS（仅要求有效样本量 ≥1/batch_size = 25%），\n      b* 自由飙升至 mean=3.85, median=2.60。大量 batch 使用 b*>5，导致\n      contaminated 样本权重趋近于零 (w=(1-0.9)^2.6=0.004)，有效训练集\n      急剧缩小。\n      PPL=17.71 > uniform (17.69)：over-downweighting 导致有效数据不足，\n      模型学习不充分。这比不做 reweighting 更差。\n      物理直觉：batch_size=4 时 n_min=1 意味着只需保留 1 个有效样本的\n      信息量——在 40% 污染下这几乎等于只用 clean 样本，丢弃了 40% 数据\n      中仍有价值的信号。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      n_min=1 是 \"too aggressive\" 端的失败案例。b* 不受约束 → 系统性\n      over-downweight → 效果不如 uniform。这为 ESS 约束的必要性提供了证据，\n      但也说明 n_min 是一个需要 \"恰好正确\" 的参数。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=4 ablation (=batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_4\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界 = batch_size（要求所有样本保持同等权重 → 强制 b*=0）。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=4=batch_size 要求 ESS ≥ batch_size，即所有权重完全均等，\n      唯一满足条件的值是 b*=0。方法退化为 uniform baseline。\n      PPL = 17.69 = uniform，验证了实现正确性（ESS 约束确实在工作）。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      预期行为——n_min=batch_size 是 uniform 的重现。与 n_min=5 一起\n      构成 \"退化端\" 的验证点。\n\n  - name: \"n_min=5 ablation (>batch_size, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p0_nmin_5\n    description: >\n      ESS 下界 > batch_size（不可能满足 → 同 n_min=4 退化为 b*=0）。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.69\n      train_loss: 7.31\n      b_star_mean: 0.0\n      b_star_median: 0.0\n      b_star_std: 0.0\n      b_star_pct_at_zero: 100.0\n      total_steps: 6103\n    result_rationale: >\n      n_min=5 > batch_size=4，ESS 约束永远无法满足（ESS 最大值 = batch_size），\n      b* 被钳制在 0。效果等同于 n_min=4 和 uniform。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"n_min Sensitivity Curve (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        rows:\n          - {n_min: 1, eval_ppl: 17.71, b_star_median: 2.60, status: \"worse than uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 2, eval_ppl: 17.65, b_star_median: 0.87, status: \"best (adaptive_fix)\"}\n          - {n_min: 3, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: \"~0.3\", status: \"≈ uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 4, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: 0.0, status: \"= uniform\"}\n          - {n_min: 5, eval_ppl: 17.69, b_star_median: 0.0, status: \"= uniform\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"n_min vs PPL 折线图，附带右轴 b* median。展示只有 n_min=2 在 sweet spot，\n        n_min=1 过度激进 (PPL>uniform)，n_min≥3 退化为 uniform。标注 worst 档\n        解读：sweet spot 窄，n_min 实质上成为 'another hyperparameter to tune'。\"\n    analysis: >\n      n_min sensitivity curve 展示一个尖锐的 sweet spot：\n      - n_min=1: 过度激进，劣于 uniform\n      - n_min=2: 唯一有效点\n      - n_min≥3: 退化为 uniform\n      这对 \"adaptive 免调参\" 的叙事构成挑战——虽然消除了 b 的 grid search，\n      但引入了 n_min 这个同样需要选取的超参。不过 n_min 的选择空间极小\n      （只有整数 1-5），比 b 的连续空间（0.1-10）简单得多。\n      worst 档 reframe：n_min 的存在承认方法并非 \"zero-hyperparameter\"，\n      但将超参搜索从 \"6+ runs 的连续 grid\" 压缩为 \"2-3 个整数点\"——仍是\n      显著的调参成本降低。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P1: ENHANCE PAPER\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"ModernBERT detector training (AUC≈0.99)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_modernbert\n    description: >\n      训练 ModernBERT 150M 检测器作为 high-end baseline。\n    expected_results:\n      auc: 0.986\n      accuracy: 0.953\n      ece_raw: 0.15\n      ece_calibrated: 0.022\n      temperature_T: 0.35\n      q_score_mean: 0.58\n      q_score_std: 0.42\n      q_score_median: 0.72\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.28\n      training_time_hours: 1.5\n      model_params: \"150M\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      ModernBERT 150M 在 real vs synthetic 分类上 AUC=0.986（与 Drayson 报告一致）。\n      相比 TF-IDF+LR (AUC=0.939)，AUC 提升 0.047。q-score 分布更 bimodal\n      （mid_range_ratio 从 0.463 降至 0.28——更多样本在极端值，更少在中间），\n      ECE 更低（更准确的概率估计）。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Detector Comparison\"\n        rows:\n          - {detector: \"TF-IDF + LR\", params: \"~50K\", auc: 0.939, ece_cal: 0.048,\n             mid_range_ratio: 0.463, training_cost: \"<1 min CPU\"}\n          - {detector: \"ModernBERT 150M\", params: \"150M\", auc: 0.986, ece_cal: 0.022,\n             mid_range_ratio: 0.28, training_cost: \"1.5h GPU\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      检测器训练成功，AUC=0.986 符合预期。关键后续问题：更高 AUC 是否转化为\n      更好的训练 PPL？p1_detector_ablation_training 将回答这个问题。\n\n  - name: \"Training with ModernBERT scores (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_detector_ablation_training\n    description: >\n      用 ModernBERT q-scores 替换 TF-IDF+LR 的 q-scores，运行 adaptive + uniform。\n      worst 档预测：AUC 0.939→0.986 不会带来显著 PPL 改善。\n    expected_results:\n      # ModernBERT scores\n      adaptive_modernbert_ppl: 17.647\n      uniform_modernbert_ppl: 17.690\n      # 对比 TF-IDF+LR scores (existing data)\n      adaptive_tfidf_ppl: 17.650\n      uniform_tfidf_ppl: 17.690\n      # 差异\n      ppl_diff_adaptive: -0.003  # ModernBERT 仅好 0.003\n      ppl_diff_relative_pct: 0.02\n      b_star_median_modernbert: 0.95\n      b_star_median_tfidf: 0.87\n    result_rationale: >\n      AUC 从 0.939 提升至 0.986 (+0.047)，但 PPL 仅改善 0.003 (0.02% relative)——\n      检测器质量的 marginal return 极低。\n      原因分析：(1) q-score 的连续性和排序正确性比 AUC 更重要——TF-IDF+LR\n      的 q-scores 虽然 calibration 不完美 (ECE=0.048 vs 0.022)，但排序已足够好\n      用于权重计算；(2) w=(1-q)^b 对 q 的 monotone transform 使得精确 q 值\n      不如排序重要；(3) ModernBERT 的更 bimodal 分布导致 b* 略高 (0.95 vs 0.87)，\n      进一步偏离真最优 b~0.2。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Detector Quality → PPL Improvement (AUC-PPL Relationship)\"\n        rows:\n          - {detector: \"TF-IDF+LR\", auc: 0.939, adaptive_ppl: 17.650,\n             delta_vs_uniform: 0.040, cost: \"<1 min CPU\"}\n          - {detector: \"ModernBERT\", auc: 0.986, adaptive_ppl: 17.647,\n             delta_vs_uniform: 0.043, cost: \"1.5h GPU\"}\n          - {improvement: \"\", auc_gain: \"+0.047\", ppl_gain: \"-0.003\",\n             marginal_value: \"negligible\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"AUC vs Δ_PPL scatter plot（仅 2 点 + 理论 ceiling），配合\n        cost annotation（1min vs 1.5h）。核心信息：3000× 计算成本换来\n        0.003 PPL 改善——lightweight detector sufficient。\"\n    analysis: >\n      这是 worst 档中最强的独立发现之一：AUC 0.939→0.986 (+5%相对)\n      仅换来 0.003 PPL 改善 (<0.02% relative)。\n      升级为 primary finding 的论据：(1) 实际影响——省去 150M 参数检测器\n      的训练和推理成本；(2) 理论解释——w=(1-q)^b 的 monotonicity 保证\n      排序正确即可，不需要精确概率；(3) 对 Drayson 框架的改进建议——\n      他们使用 ModernBERT 是 overkill。\n      Reframe 3 的核心支撑实验。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator data (Llama-3.2-1B generates, Qwen3-0.6B trains)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_datagen\n    description: >\n      用 Llama-3.2-1B 生成合成数据，Qwen3-0.6B 训练——模拟 web corpus\n      中不同来源的合成内容。TF-IDF+LR 检测器在 cross-family 数据上打分。\n    expected_results:\n      synthetic_generator: \"Llama-3.2-1B\"\n      training_model: \"Qwen3-0.6B\"\n      contamination_ratio: 0.4\n      total_tokens: 200000000\n      detector_auc_cross_family: 0.891\n      q_score_mean: 0.55\n      q_score_std: 0.35\n      q_score_median: 0.58\n      mid_range_ratio: 0.52\n    result_rationale: >\n      cross-family 检测更难：TF-IDF+LR 在训练时只见过 Qwen3-0.6B 的合成数据，\n      Llama-3.2-1B 的合成文本风格不同，AUC 从 0.939 降至 0.891。\n      q-score 分布更 diffuse（mid_range_ratio 从 0.463 升至 0.52——更多样本\n      在 0.3-0.7 的不确定区间），median 从 0.707 降至 0.58。\n      这意味着检测器对 cross-family 合成数据的 \"信心\" 更低，q-score 排序\n      更不可靠。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      检测器 cross-family 泛化受限——AUC 降至 0.891，q-score 分布变得 diffuse。\n      这预示 adaptive b* 在这些 noisier scores 上可能表现不佳。\n\n  - name: \"Cross-generator training (adaptive + uniform, ρ=0.4)\"\n    plan_id: p1_cross_generator_training\n    description: >\n      用 cross-family q-scores 运行 adaptive 和 uniform。\n      worst 档核心预测：adaptive 在 noisy q-scores 上劣于 uniform。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.75\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.77\n      delta_adaptive_abs: -0.02  # negative: adaptive WORSE than uniform\n      b_star_mean: 1.15\n      b_star_median: 0.72\n      b_star_std: 1.65\n      b_star_p25: 0.35\n      b_star_p75: 1.30\n    result_rationale: >\n      cross-family q-scores 的高 mid_range_ratio (0.52) 和低 AUC (0.891) 导致\n      两个问题：(1) α_eff 估计不准确——大量样本 q 在 0.3-0.7，既非明确 clean\n      也非明确 contaminated，使 α_eff 的 batch-level 估计噪声大；(2) b* 仍在\n      ~0.72 (高于真最优)，且方差更大，导致某些 batch 的权重严重失调。\n      最终 adaptive PPL (17.77) > uniform (17.75)：noisy reweighting 比不 reweight\n      更差。有害降权的数据量超过了有益降权的收益。\n      uniform PPL (17.75) 高于 self-gen 条件 (17.69)，因为 Llama-1B 合成数据\n      质量更低（更小模型生成的文本更差）。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Cross-Generator Performance\"\n        rows:\n          - {setting: \"self-gen (Qwen→Qwen)\", uniform_ppl: 17.690,\n             adaptive_ppl: 17.650, delta: -0.040, verdict: \"adaptive wins\"}\n          - {setting: \"cross-gen (Llama→Qwen)\", uniform_ppl: 17.750,\n             adaptive_ppl: 17.770, delta: +0.020, verdict: \"adaptive LOSES\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"q-score 分布对比：self-gen (bimodal, well-separated) vs cross-gen\n        (diffuse, overlapping)。展示检测器信号质量如何影响 reweighting 效果。\"\n    analysis: >\n      cross-generator 是 worst 档的关键失败场景。当检测器信号质量下降\n      (AUC 0.939→0.891)，adaptive 从 \"有益\" 翻转为 \"有害\"。\n      这暴露了方法的根本依赖：adaptive b* 的质量完全取决于 q-score 的\n      信号噪声比。在 real-world web corpus 中，合成数据来源多样\n      （多个 generator family），检测器 AUC 可能更低——方法的实用性\n      在最需要它的场景中反而最差。\n      叙事影响：Claim 3 (\"unknown contamination proportion\") 受损——\n      不仅比例未知，合成来源也未知，而后者对方法有效性的影响更大。\n\n  - name: \"Detect-and-remove baseline (threshold=0.5, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_detect_remove\n    description: >\n      硬阈值过滤：q>0.5 的样本直接删除，在剩余数据上 uniform 训练。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.68\n      train_loss: 7.45\n      total_steps: 3662  # 约 60% of 6103 (去掉了部分数据)\n      effective_data_ratio: 0.58\n      samples_removed_pct: 42.0\n      false_positive_rate: 0.03  # 3% clean samples incorrectly removed\n    result_rationale: >\n      threshold=0.5 删除约 42% 数据（40% 真合成 + ~2% 假阳性 clean 样本）。\n      PPL=17.68——优于 uniform (17.69) 但劣于 grid-best b=0.2 (17.637)。\n      在 worst 档中，detect-and-remove 是 \"过度激进\" 的极端：完全移除 vs\n      gentle reweighting (b=0.2, w=0.63)。移除丢失了合成数据中的有用信号\n      （虽然分布有偏，但仍包含语言模式信息），而 gentle reweighting 保留了\n      这些信号的 63%。\n      但 detect-and-remove 比 aggressive adaptive (b*=0.87, w=0.13) 的效果\n      接近——都是\"过度处理\"的不同程度。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      detect-and-remove (PPL=17.68) 略优于 uniform (17.69)，略劣于\n      adaptive (17.65)。在 worst 档的全局 picture 中：\n      gentle reweighting (b=0.2, PPL=17.637) >> adaptive (b*≈0.87, PPL=17.65)\n      ≈ detect-and-remove (PPL=17.68) > uniform (PPL=17.69)。\n      adaptive 优于 detect-and-remove 仍然成立，但 margin 很小 (0.03)。\n\n  - name: \"Random reweighting baseline (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n    plan_id: p1_baseline_random_reweight\n    description: >\n      用随机权重（不基于检测器）训练，验证检测器信号的必要性。\n    expected_results:\n      eval_ppl_holdout: 17.695\n      train_loss: 7.33\n      total_steps: 6103\n      weight_mean: 1.0\n      weight_std: 0.5\n    result_rationale: >\n      随机权重 (uniform [0, 2] 或 similar) 均值为 1，期望上等同于 uniform\n      训练。额外的梯度噪声（权重方差引入）使 PPL 微升 0.005。\n      random 不含任何数据质量信号 → 无法区分 clean vs contaminated →\n      表现近似 uniform。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Baseline Comparison (ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B, seed42)\"\n        rows:\n          - {method: \"uniform\", ppl: 17.690, delta: 0.000, signal: \"none\"}\n          - {method: \"random reweight\", ppl: 17.695, delta: +0.005, signal: \"random\"}\n          - {method: \"detect-and-remove\", ppl: 17.680, delta: -0.010, signal: \"hard threshold\"}\n          - {method: \"adaptive b*\", ppl: 17.650, delta: -0.040, signal: \"adaptive q-based\"}\n          - {method: \"grid-best b=0.2\", ppl: 17.637, delta: -0.053, signal: \"oracle grid\"}\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Baseline 条形图：方法 vs PPL delta，展示信号阶梯 random < hard < adaptive < grid-best。\"\n    analysis: >\n      random reweighting ≈ uniform 确认检测器信号是 load-bearing——\n      不是 \"任何形式的权重扰动\" 都有效，必须是与数据质量相关的信号。\n      这支持了 adaptive 方法的合理性（虽然不是最优，但利用了真实信号）。\n\n  # ============================================================\n  # P2: IF GPU BUDGET ALLOWS\n  # ============================================================\n\n  - name: \"Domain-skewed injection (code-heavy contamination, ρ=0.4, Qwen3-0.6B)\"\n    plan_id: p2_domain_skewed\n    description: >\n      合成数据集中在代码领域（非 uniform random injection）。\n      worst 档预测：domain skew 导致 q-score 分布崩坏，adaptive 失效。\n    expected_results:\n      uniform_ppl: 17.73\n      adaptive_ppl: 17.76\n      delta_adaptive: -0.03  # adaptive WORSE\n      b_star_mean: 1.55\n      b_star_median: 1.10\n      q_score_distribution_skewness: 1.8\n      domain_contamination_code_pct: 0.85\n      domain_contamination_text_pct: 0.15\n    result_rationale: >\n      domain-skewed injection 使 q-score 分布在不同 domain batch 间高度不均：\n      code-heavy batch 几乎全是合成 (q 全高) → α_eff 估计偏高 → b* 过大；\n      text batch 几乎无合成 (q 全低) → α_eff~0 → b*=0。\n      这种 bimodal batch structure 使 per-batch adaptive 策略失效：在 code batch\n      中过度降权（但 code 数据可能有用），在 text batch 中完全不降权（但\n      可能有少量未检测到的合成 text）。\n      整体效果：adaptive (17.76) > uniform (17.73)，降权带来的 harm 超过 benefit。\n    tables: []\n    figures_description:\n      - \"batch-level b* vs q_score_mean scatter，展示 domain-skewed 下\n        b* 的 bimodal 分布——code batch b*>2, text batch b*=0，\n        对比 uniform injection 下的 unimodal b* 分布。\"\n    analysis: >\n      domain-skewed 是 adaptive 的另一个失败模式。方法假设 contamination\n      在 batch 间大致均匀分布，当 domain skew 打破这个假设时，per-batch\n      adaptation 反而放大了 skew 的负面影响。\n      叙事影响：在论文 Limitations 中讨论 domain-skewed contamination\n      作为方法的适用边界。\n\n  - name: \"Downstream eval (MMLU/HellaSwag on Llama-3.2-3B checkpoints)\"\n    plan_id: p2_downstream_eval\n    description: >\n      在 3B 模型 checkpoint 上评估 MMLU 和 HellaSwag，验证 PPL 改善\n      是否传导到下游任务。worst 档预测：完全无可测增益。\n    expected_results:\n      # Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4, seed42\n      uniform_mmlu_acc: 25.8\n      adaptive_mmlu_acc: 25.8\n      mmlu_delta_abs_pct: 0.0\n      uniform_hellaswag_acc: 38.2\n      adaptive_hellaswag_acc: 38.3\n      hellaswag_delta_abs_pct: 0.1\n      pppl_to_downstream_correlation: \"not significant\"\n    result_rationale: >\n      3B 模型在 200M tokens 上严重 undertrain，MMLU 近随机水平 (25.8% ≈ 25% random)，\n      HellaSwag 在 38% 左右。adaptive 的 PPL 改善仅 0.01 (0.06% relative)，\n      完全不足以传导到下游 benchmark——这些 benchmark 的测量精度（~0.5% absolute）\n      远粗于 PPL 差异 (0.06% relative)。\n      即使在 PPL 改善更大的 0.6B 设定 (0.23% relative)，下游任务的 resolution\n      也不足以检测到差异。PPL 是连续指标，下游 accuracy 是离散指标，\n      两者的灵敏度不在同一量级。\n    tables:\n      - caption: \"Downstream Eval (Llama-3.2-3B, ρ=0.4, seed42, 200M tokens)\"\n        rows:\n          - {benchmark: \"MMLU (5-shot)\", uniform: \"25.8%\", adaptive: \"25.8%\",\n             delta: \"0.0%\", significance: \"n.s.\"}\n          - {benchmark: \"HellaSwag (10-shot)\", uniform: \"38.2%\", adaptive: \"38.3%\",\n             delta: \"+0.1%\", significance: \"n.s.\"}\n    figures_description: []\n    analysis: >\n      下游任务无可测增益，符合 worst 档预期。这不一定是方法的失败——\n      200M tokens 的 undertrained 3B 模型本身不应被期望展示有意义的\n      下游差异。但这确实意味着论文不能 claim \"PPL improvement translates\n      to downstream gains\"。\n      叙事处理：(1) 承认当前规模下下游差异不显著；(2) 论证 PPL 改善\n      本身有价值（预训练评估的标准指标）；(3) 指出 full-scale 实验\n      (3B+ 模型, 10B+ tokens) 下效应可能放大，作为 future work。\n```\n\n核心总结：worst 档下 22 个实验的预测呈现三个主题——\n\n1. **adaptive overshoot 暴露**：finer grid 揭示真最优 b=0.2，adaptive median b*=0.87 系统性偏高 4×，aggregate ratio 从 88.6% 降至 ~70%\n2. **泛化性不足**：60% 污染效应不放大，3B 模型改善接近噪声，cross-generator 和 domain-skewed 场景 adaptive 劣于 uniform\n3. **三条替代线索成立**：lightweight detector sufficiency (AUC +5% → PPL +0.02%)、α_eff 的诊断价值（b* 轨迹反映 batch 结构）、n_min sensitivity 揭示方法的设计空间——足够撑起 EMNLP 投稿的 reframed narrative","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"dd23c038-e166-40a7-844f-b6091990c211","total_cost_usd":1.18563675,"usage":{"input_tokens":5,"cache_creation_input_tokens":43073,"cache_read_input_tokens":103083,"output_tokens":34188,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":43073,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":16087,"cache_read_input_tokens":37078,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17836,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":17836},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":10044,"outputTokens":24,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.010164000000000001,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":5,"outputTokens":34188,"cacheReadInputTokens":103083,"cacheCreationInputTokens":43073,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.17547275,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"9a94a254-7206-4ad7-9059-673d167a6f3b"}
